      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/13/russian-plot-kill-ukrainian-american-thwarted-poland-says-polish-pm",
      "description": "<p>Donald Tusk says it is first time ‘someone on the order of Russia’ has sought to attack US citizen in Nato country</p><p>A Russian plan to kill a Ukrainian American citizen in Warsaw was thwarted by Poland before it could be carried out, the Polish prime minister has said.</p><p>Donald Tusk said it was the first time that “someone on the order of Russia” had sought to attack a US citizen on the territory of another Nato country.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/13/russian-plot-kill-ukrainian-american-thwarted-poland-says-polish-pm\">Continue reading...</a>",
